OL,3,CA-Level results day: Cumberland and
OL,4,CWestmorland & Furness results below
OL,5,Caverage
OL,7,FStudents in Cumbria have today picked
OL,8,Fup their A-Level results, and
OL,9,Fdiscovered whether their hard work
OL,10,Fpaid off.
OL,12,FAcross the county, however, A-Level
OL,13,Fresults were below the national
OL,14,Faverage in England. Nationwide, 28.3%
OL,15,Fof results awarded were an A or A*.
OL,17,FIn Cumberland, the proportion of A or
OL,18,FA* grades awarded was 18.5%, 1% down
OL,19,Fon last year's proportion of 19.5%.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/4
