OL,3,CA-Level results day: Cumberland and
OL,4,CWestmorland & Furness results below
OL,5,Caverage
OL,7,FIn Westmorland and Furness, the
OL,8,Fresults were slightly better, with
OL,9,F20.1% of grades awarded being A or A*
OL,10,F- a small decrease on last year's
OL,11,Ffigure of 20.7%.
OL,13,FITV Border has followed five students
OL,14,Facross their A-Level journey, from
OL,15,Fchoosing subjects to receiving their
OL,16,Fresults today. You can find our
OL,17,Fprevious reports below:
OL,19,FNext steps: five students and their A-
OL,20,FLevel journeys
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/4
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
