OL,3,CA-Level results day: Cumberland and
OL,4,CWestmorland & Furness results below
OL,5,Caverage
OL,7,FResults day comes amid a crisis in the
OL,8,Fnumber of young people not in
OL,9,Feducation, employment or training
OL,10,F(Neet).
OL,12,FThe Department for Education estimates
OL,13,Fthat nearly 58,000 18-year-olds in
OL,14,FEngland will get no results on
OL,15,FThursday because they have dropped out
OL,16,Fof education and training, although
OL,17,Fsome are working instead.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/4
