OL,3,CA-Level results day: Cumberland and
OL,4,CWestmorland & Furness results below
OL,5,Caverage
OL,7,FThe latest data, published in May,
OL,8,Fshowed the number of young people aged
OL,9,F16 to 24 neither working nor learning
OL,10,Fsurpassed one million for the first
OL,11,Ftime since 2013, reaching 1.01 million
OL,12,Fin the three months from January to
OL,13,FMarch.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/4
